# Upstream reference checkouts pulled by init.sh — never commit these.
# No trailing slash: in worktrees init.sh creates these as symlinks, which a
# directory-only pattern (`/pokeemerald/`) would not match. These anchored
# patterns ignore a dir or a symlink of that name.
/pokeemerald
/mgba

# The local, gitignored asset pack `cargo xtask extract` produces (S-4, F-3,
# issue #81, Discussion #71 policy A). Never committed, never a CI artifact,
# never embedded in a binary or release archive — see
# `crates/xtask/src/extract/mod.rs`'s module docs.
/assets-pack

# A cartridge image (Discussion #71 policy C, issue #122). The importer reads
# one the player supplies; it never enters git, CI, artifacts, or logs.
*.gba
*.GBA

# `cargo xtask record-snapshot` output (F-3, V-4, issue #226): local frame
# captures + metadata, gitignored by default like `/assets-pack` above — only
# a capture's recorded hash is committed (`docs/snapshots.md`'s blessing
# table), never the pixel/metadata files themselves. See
# `crates/xtask/src/record_snapshot.rs`'s module docs.
/snapshots

# Rust build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and local scratch
*.log
/tmp/
/scratch/

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
